About Gnarls Barkley

Gnarls Barkley is the Grammy Award–winning duo of CeeLo Green and Danger Mouse. Their debut St. Elsewhere (2006) produced classics like Crazy, Smiley Faces, and Gone Daddy Gone, while their follow-up The Odd Couple (2008) included Run (I’m a Natural Disaster), Going On, Who’s Gonna Save My Soul, Who Cares?, Go-Go Gadget Gospel, and Mystery Man.

Outside of the duo, CeeLo Green achieved solo success with hits like Forget You (F**k You), Bright Lights Bigger City, Closet Freak, I Want You (Hold On to Love), and Music To My Soul.

